This port uses Intel's FreeBSD NVMUpdate executable with Lenovo's current
E810 AnyOS firmware payload.  Lenovo publishes the four adapters as one AnyOS
bundle, but does not include an nvmupdate.cfg in that bundle.  The FreeBSD
configuration combines the four device entries and complete ETrack histories
from Lenovo's corresponding first-party per-adapter NVMUpdate packages.

The .pldm files inside Lenovo's AnyOS payload are byte-for-byte identical to
the NVM .bin files in those per-adapter packages.  They are renamed at install
time only so the combined configuration uses Lenovo's original NVM filenames.
